## 📊 Quality Gates

![Go Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/go-1.27-blue)
![Coverage](https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guided-traffic/mosquitto-operator/main/.github/badges/coverage.json)

A release is only cut from a commit on `main` for which the whole `Test and Release`
workflow went green: linting, gosec, govulncheck, cyclomatic complexity, generated
manifests, unit, integration and E2E tests, the image-tools check and both malware
scans.

## 🐳 Docker Image

```bash
docker pull guidedtraffic/mosquitto-operator:{{version}}
```

## ⎈ Helm Chart

```bash
helm repo add mosquitto-operator https://guided-traffic.github.io/mosquitto-operator/
helm repo update
helm install mosquitto-operator mosquitto-operator/mosquitto-operator --version {{version}}
```

